IT:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Oh,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} guarda un po' che bel retino!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Stai andando a caccia di insetti,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} eh,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}?
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Allora cerca vicino a fiori e alberi!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Gli insetti adorano il dolce polline{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
che si trova sulle piante!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Sai, per loro il polline è come
{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:000E:0001:}}{{TAG:0005:0010:0000}} per me!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Oo,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ağa bak!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Böcek avına
gidiyorsun galiba,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} ha,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}?
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Çiçeklere ve ağaçlara bak!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Tatlı tatlı polen nerede varsa{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
böcek de oradadır!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Polen deyince
kulağa tatlı bir {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0005:0010:0000}} gibi
geliyor, değil mi?

{{TAG:0003:0027:}}O baltayla ağaç keseceksen{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
kütüğü bırakır mısın?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Dinlenip
oturmak istediğimde mükemmel
oluyorlar,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Was willst du mit deiner Schleuder
eigentlich abschießen?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} {{TAG:0003:000B:}}Ballons?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Raumschiffe?
{{TAG:0003:0012:}}Oder etwa mich?{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:000E:}}Oh bitte, nein!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Schieß nicht auf mich, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!

EN:
I'm jealous {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}of your bubbles!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}Someday,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} I'd like to take a nap
inside a giant bubble,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

ES:
¡Qué envidia me dan tus pompitas!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}Me pregunto si sería posible{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} dormir
la siesta en una pompa gigante...

TRANSLATION:
Baloncuklarını kıskandım {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}Bir gün{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} dev bir baloncuğun
içinde uyumak istiyorum,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Ooh, a pinwheel!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} How cool!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Thing is,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} I can't stare at it for too
long{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} or I get kind of dizzy.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}¡Ooh, un molinete!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡Cómo mola!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Lo malo{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} es que si lo miro mucho
tiempo, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}¡me empiezo a marear!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Oooh, una girandola!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Miticaaa!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}È bella,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ma guai a fissarla troppo{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
o ti viene il mal di mare!

{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Uau!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Dei fuochi d'artificio!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}I miei preferiti si chiamano
stelle filanti!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}¡Ooh!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡Un martillo de juguete!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Me encanta el ruidito que hace
cuando empiezas a atizar con él.
{{TAG:0003:0028:}}Pero{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} no tiene ni la mitad de gracia{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
cuando es a ti a quien le pegan.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}
¡Así que aparta, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Oooh!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Un martello di gomma!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Mi piace un sacco il rumore
che fa quando colpisce qualcosa.
Però{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} quando ti picchiano{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
in testa con quell'affare,
non è proprio il massimo.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Quindi stammi lontan{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!

DE:
Mit einem Kaffee rumlaufen...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Das finde ich ganz schön cool,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}If you spin your umbrella around,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
you can send raindrops flying!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0028:}}But {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}don't do it in a crowd.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}That won't make you any friends.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Şemsiyeyi döndürürsen{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} yağmur
damlaları etrafa fırlar!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0028:}}Ama {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
kalabalıkta yapma.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Öyle arkadaş edinilmez.

{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Karlı günlerde şemsiye lazım mı
değil mi{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} hiç emin olamıyorum.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}
Ama sen çözmüş gibisin,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.
